# Frontend-Only Auth & JSON Data Layer (PostgreSQL-Ready)

Convert the login system from backend API calls to a **pure frontend JS implementation** using `localStorage` + structured JSON data. The JSON schema mirrors PostgreSQL relational tables for easy future migration.

## User Review Required

> [!IMPORTANT]
> **No backend dependency** — the entire auth flow, demo data, and session management will run client-side only. When you're ready to connect PostgreSQL, the JSON structure maps 1-to-1 to SQL tables.

> [!NOTE]
> The left-side branding panel (Republic of the Philippines • Northern Bukidnon State College) and the premium split layout are **fully preserved** — no visual changes.

